= The Young Plan and the fall of the coalition

The Foreign Ministry under [? if foreign_minister_party = "Z": Heinrich Bruning ?][? if foreign_minister_party = "DVP": Gustav Stresemann ?] has agreed to the Young Plan, an agreement with the Western powers to reduce Germany's reparation payments and give us more fiscal autonomy. Simultaneously, France will agree to withdraw its military occupation from the Rhineland.

While this seems to be a positive development for the country, the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**DNVP**</span> opposes the plan, claiming that any reparations are a form of national slavery. As such, they have exited the coalition with a vote of no confidence being called by the <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span>. 

Whether the government shall fall is dependent on the vote.

- @no-matter
- @groko

@no_matter
title: The [+ chancellor +] cabinet has lost the motion of no confidence. 
subtitle: The anti-government parties have over 50% of the vote.
call: set_next_election_time
on-arrival: time_to_election = 3; spd_in_government = 0; in_right_coalition = 0; in_grand_coalition = 0; spd_toleration = 0; pro_republic -= 5; dnvp_relation -= 5; 

The <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Bürgerblock**</span> coalition has fallen. New elections have been set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +]. 

@groko
title: Can we form a Grand Coalition from the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> to the <span style="color: #C0A054;">**DVP**</span>?
subtitle: The parties of the middle would prefer not to have new elections. 
choose-if: spd_votes < spd_r + 3 and spd_relation >= 45 and rdi_balance >= 1130 and grand_coalition >= 50
unavailable-subtitle: [? if grand_coalition < 50: - We do not have enough seats to form this government. ?][? if spd_votes > spd_r + 3: - The <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> stands to gain from new elections. ?][? if spd_relation < 45: - We do not have adequate relations with the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>. ?][? if rdi_balance < 1130: - The industrialists within the <span style="color: #C0A054;">**DVP**</span> refuse to work with the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>. ?]
on-arrival: in_grand_coalition = 1; in_popular_front = 0; in_left_front = 0; in_right_coalition = 0; spd_in_government = 1;
